via ESPN and USA Today page reads: 2026 No. 1 overall pick Fernando Mendoza debuted for Raiders late in 45-17 loss to Patriots at Gillette Stadium, Week 5, Oct 11 2026; entered with ~6:00 left down 28; 6-of-8, 48 yards; coach Klint Kubiak: 'He did a good job.' No newer development.",
