 {
  "id": "art-0055-djibouti-migrant-boat-2026",
  "slug": "migrant-boat-capsizes-djibouti-139-dead-iom-confirms",
  "headline": "At Least 139 Dead, Including 15 Children, After Migrant Boat Capsizes Off Djibouti",
  "socialHeadline": "An overcrowded boat carrying 305 people capsized off Djibouti: 139 dead including 15 children, 84 still missing, the UN migration agency says",
  "summary": "The UN's International Organization for Migration confirmed that at least 139 people, including 15 children, died when an overcrowded boat carrying 305 migrants capsized off Djibouti on the night of 8\u20139 October \u2014 one of the deadliest shipwrecks on the Eastern migration route.",
  "body": [
   "At least 139 people, including 15 children, died when an overcrowded boat capsized off Djibouti earlier this month, the UN's International Organization for Migration (IOM) has confirmed, in one of the deadliest shipwrecks on the Eastern migration route.",
   "The boat, carrying 305 people from Djibouti toward Yemen, went down near Guhere, north of Obock, during the night of October 8\u20139. IOM attributed the capsizing to overcrowding.",
   "## The confirmed toll",
   "According to IOM's updated count, 139 people are dead \u2014 52 men, 42 women and 15 children, including nine girls and six boys. Another 84 people remain missing, and 82 survivors were rescued; all of the survivors are Ethiopian nationals.",
   "The figures were confirmed by IOM's chief of mission in Djibouti, Alexandre Coissac, speaking to the Associated Press. Djiboutian authorities are continuing search-and-rescue operations, and IOM is assisting survivors at its migrant response centre in Obock.",
   "## Toll may still rise",
   "IOM cautioned that the official count could rise further: some victims were buried by fellow migrants before they could be identified, and they will not be included until authorities verify them.",
   "The Eastern Route \u2014 from the Horn of Africa across the Bab el-Mandeb strait to Yemen \u2014 remains one of the world's most dangerous migration corridors, used by tens of thousands of migrants each year."
  ],
  "category": "World",
  "tags": [
   "Djibouti",
   "Migration",
   "IOM",
   "Eastern Route",
   "Shipwreck"
  ],
