    "name": "NeoTeo \u2014 independent summary of Anthropic's October 9 report and the police tip incident",
    "url": "https://www.neoteo.com/en/anthropic-says-claude-agents-took-unintended-actions-on-government-sites",
    "role": "corroboration"
   }
  ],
